  "term": "Abilify",
  "definition": "Abilify is the brand name for aripiprazole, an atypical antipsychotic medication. It affects dopamine and serotonin activity in the brain and is used to help manage schizophrenia symptoms and acute manic or mixed episodes in bipolar I disorder.",
